window.products.push({"id":942011,"name":"Bohepuffex Handmade Moroccan Pouf Foot stool Round & Large Storage Cover Bohemian style ottoman an Exotic Décor for Living Room Bedroom or Wedding Gif","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yyS3WRuiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Moroccan Pouffe & Ottoman About Bohepuffex ： Bohepuffex is committed to manufacturing Home furnitures with Arabian style and classic style. Inspired by the design style of Moroccan pouf. we use smooth-finished leather which has the sturdy and durable properties of genuine leather and this leather eliminates the uncomfortable odor of genuine leather. our products have many specifications, round, square, oval, embroidered, various colors and patterns. We have many customers in many countries all over the world. such as Japan, South Korea, Europe, America, Middle East, China, etc. Applicable Space： In the lobby, bedroom, yard, office, cafe, outdoor, etc. Product Details: - Shape: Round. - Material: PU Synthetic leather. - Dimensions: 21.6 inches Diameter, 11.8 inches High when filled. - Color: Color blocking. Product Features: - Constructed using high quality faux PU Leather. - dirt-resistant and easy to clean. - Vegan materials and Eco-friendly. - Versatile round shape. - Ideal as a side table, ottoman, foot stool, extra seating, and more! - The hidden zipper can protect your floor and prevent the back of the cushion from opening automatically. Product Care: Wipe clean with cloth. Do not wash in water. Do not dry clean. Do not iron. Do not use sharp objects to scratch or scrape the surfaces of the Pouf. Use mild leather cleaner, detergent or solvent-based cleaners when needed. ATTENTION: The poufs are shipped UNSTUFFED. You can use polyester or cotton fiber filling, old clothes, towels, pillows to make it as firm or as soft as you want. We Provide Premium Service ： Don't hesitate to contact us for more information. We will be happy to answer any questions. If you have any questions, we will solve it for you .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yyS3WRuiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bohepuffex","source_asin":"B09X41WS9J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942011","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X41WS9J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X41WS9J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":942012,"name":"River City Clocks One Day Cuckoo Clock Cottage with Tree, Mushroom and Water Pump","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":289.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dR9zNCibL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Black forest cuckoo clock displays a tree, mushroom, and waterpump at the base of the clock. On the top of every hour the cuckoo clock cuckoos. (Example: At one o'clock the bird will cuckoo once. At eight o'clock the bird will cuckoo eight times) The half hour is announced with one cuckoo call. There is also a manual night shut off switch that allows you to mute the cuckoo sound. Two cast iron pine cone weights are suspended beneath the clock case by two separate brass chains. The hand-made pendulum continously swings back and forth controlling the timing of the clock. The 30 hour all brass mechanical Regula movement is wound once per day by raising the two pine cone weights. One weight powers the time and the other weight powers the cuckoo and cuckoo call. Great effort has been made to portray each cuckoo clock as accurately as possible. As with many handmade items, the exact coloration and carving may vary slightly from clock to clock. We consider this to be a special part of their character. This clock is covered by a two year limited warranty covering workmanship and manufacturers defects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41dR9zNCibL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"River City Clocks","source_asin":"B009FX5FEO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942012","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009FX5FEO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009FX5FEO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
