window.products.push({"id":942065,"name":"Signature Design by Ashley Darcy Casual Plush Square Accent Ottoman, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":270.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZlJjicG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Talk about fine lines and great curves. That’s the beauty of this standout ottoman—made to suit your appreciation for simplicity and love of contemporary style. Tapered feet and an ultra-soft upholstery that holds up to everyday living complete this fashion statement. With a wide variety of styles and materials, our ottomans are a great option if you need comfort, elegance and versatility. They're an ideal addition to living room seating arrangements and accent chairs alike. Whether you're looking for a bohemian patterned ottoman or a chic tufted option, we have something just right for you. Trust us to bring your space to life with furniture and decor that show off your style personality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZlJjicG4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Signature Design by Ashley","source_asin":"B07566HND9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07566HND9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07566HND9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":942066,"name":"IPKIG 73.2\" Futon Sofa Bed, Convertible Sleeper Sofa, Loveseat Couch, Faux Leather Split-Back Sofabed for Small Spaces Room Home Office Hotel with Adj","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711MaZSXhcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌈【2-IN-1 DESIGN SOFA BED】The convertible and compact design of the futon sofa bed makes it ideal for studios, apartments, dormitories, guest rooms, offices, game rooms, and living rooms. Enjoy this convertible faux leather sofa during the day or use it as a single sofa bed at night. Suitable for small rooms that can't accommodate too much furniture. Works great for overnight guests. With practical function, this sofa bed is also a nice piece of home/office furniture. 🌈【CONVERTIBLE FUTON SOFA BED】Thanks to the click-clack mechanism, you can set the futon sofa bed in 3 positions: upright, slightly reclined and flat, using it as a couch, lounger or sleeper bed. More pleasantly surprised about the split back sofa that allows one side to recline while the other side remains upright. This loveseat sleeper can easily adjust to whatever activity you have - from enjoy meaningful chat, reading or watch a long-awaited sports event to having a quick nap or a good-night sleep. 🌈【MAXIMUM STABILIITY & DURABILITY】The sturdy solid hardwood sofa frame is wrapped in supportive foam and durable leather fabric, the maximum load 300lbs/seat. The sleeper couches for small spaces with a zipper compartment in its backrest for storing support rod, innovative design of hidden support stick provide extra safety support when converting to bed. Loveseat sleeper dimensions: L73\" x W27\" x H40\", Bed size: L66.9\" x W39.4\" x H15.7\". 🌈【EASY TO CLEAN】Durable faux leather makes for added comfort and easy wipe to clean. Even if you accidentally pour your drink on the convertible sleeper sofa, all you need to do is wipe it off without leaving any traces. This loveseat sofa also has side pockets, provides ample room to place magazines, books, remote controllers and other things at hand. 【EASY TO ASSEMBLE & 2 PACKAGES】 Unpacking and assembling had never been so easy, fast and fun. Together with installation manuals, all the parts needed are packaged separately. Just 3 steps, you can get this nice futons beds within less than 15 minutes. THIS FUTON SOFA BEDS WILL BE SENT BY THE FORM OF 2 SEPARATE PACKAGES. Please feel free to contact us thru Amazon if you have any questions, we will always be there for you, and hope we will bring you the best shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711MaZSXhcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IPKIG","source_asin":"B09N71JBTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N71JBTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N71JBTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
