window.products.push({"id":942074,"name":"11 Pack Inflatable Cup Holder Pool Toy - Unicorn Donuts Flamingo Palm Tree and Duck Floating Drink Holder for Pool Party Summer Swimming Event, 4 styl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nBRGEALSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Super Cool Inflatable Cup Holder package will make your swimming party more fun! Not only do you no longer have to constantly hold your drink while in the water, but you can float it in style. You are definitely getting compliments of \"where did you get that?\" while you offer your guest these drink holder. They are great for pools, hot tubs and lakes or even rivers and oceans if you keep an eye on them. Quality Guarantee: All of our rafts are inflation tested before packaging, but rarely a defective raft will slip through. If you receive a raft that is not 100% perfect, contact us and we will make things right. Make sure you keep the package and take pictures when you report the defective product. We are here to help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nBRGEALSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SimpleHTV","source_asin":"B0717BK6V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0717BK6V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0717BK6V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":942075,"name":"Gusnilo Ashtray with Lid Ceramic Ashtray Desktop Ashtray Windproof Ashtray Outdoor,Indoor Office Home Ashtray Practical Decorative Handmade Ashtray,Gi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wPHJAUkaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Combination of Classical and Modern Art】Gusnilo ceramic ashtray is made of 72 ancient processes and high temperature firing. We use ancient processes combined with modern art to make an ashtray. You can trust his high quality and Practicality, add icing on your home decor. Not limited to smokers, it is also a good choice for placing small accessories. 【Intimate Design】They don't look like ashtrays because they are beautiful, don't they? The ashtray lid keeps the ashes from flying away in the breeze. You don't have to deal with scattered ashes, and your clothes won't smell of smoke because they're well sealed in the ashtray by the lid. Keep your smoking area clean and hygienic. 【Beautiful and Practical】Our ceramic ashtray has three circular card slots, allowing you to place cigarettes stably and free your hands. The ashtray has a large internal capacity and can hold three packs of ash. Not only suitable for home, but such a stylish ashtray is also very eye-catching in the office or the front desk, making your guests feel honored. 【Gifts You Can't Put It Down】The ceramic ashtray is exquisitely shaped, and each ashtray is handmade and is the first choice for holiday gifts. It can always bring surprises to you. Whether it is Valentine's Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving, Christmas, and other festivals, Or for housewarming, opening ceremonies and other occasions, this ashtray is very suitable for you to give as a gift to friends and relatives. 【Kiln Transmutation Ashtrays】We hope to bring you artistic daily necessities and add color to your living corners. Our ashtrays adopt the kiln transformation process, their texture distribution is different, and each ashtray is unique. You will get an exclusive ashtray.If you are not satisfied after receiving the ceramic ashtray, please feel free to contact us. The Gusnilo service team will provide you with a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wPHJAUkaL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gusnilo","source_asin":"B0BRK6X78Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942075","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRK6X78Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRK6X78Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
