window.products.push({"id":942162,"name":"Manual Handheld Coffee Grinder - Portable Whole Bean Conical Burr Hand Cranked Mill, Perfect for Travel and Tight Spaces - Holds 3 TBSP Beans","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61070x1w16L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You want to be able to enjoy freshly ground coffee at home and on the go? We have designed our grinders to be portable and lightweight and to grind your beans perfectly every time. While other grinders chop your coffee beans, our conical burr crushes the grounds so the extraction remains the same all the way through. We know you want a reliable coffee grinder, so we have crafted ours with premium materials. From the stainless steel and acrylic body to the high-grade ceramic burr, you’ll know this handy tool will stay in your kitchen for years. Why Coffee Yeah Manual Coffee Grinder: No batteries or plugging in is required making it perfect for camping and travel Quiet operation so you don’t have to worry about waking anyone in the morning or disturbing those around you Easy to disassemble for cleaning Ergonomic design makes it super easy and comfortable to operate Handle folds for easy storage and does not disconnect so your wont misplace it High-grade ceramic conical burrs create a precise grind every time Shatter proof and transparent acrylic display so you can see if your beans are ground to your liking Dimensions: 2.5 x 2.5 x 7.8 inches Weight: 10.4 ounces Guarantee: Your enjoyment is our top priority and we are fully confident you will love your new manual grinder, however if for any reason you are unhappy just contact us directly and we will handle it. Start enjoying freshly ground coffee either at home or on the go with your new Coffee Yeah manual coffee grinder","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61070x1w16L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Coffee Yeah","source_asin":"B07VHHKDZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VHHKDZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VHHKDZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":942163,"name":"STFU I'm Reading Infused With An Escape From Reality | Premium Soy Wax Candle | The Malicious Mermaid | Amber Jar Candle | Made in USA | Snarky Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WbqHESURL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"STFU...I'm Reading Infused With An Escape From RealityFill your home with the fragrance of our 100% all natural soy wax products created without any phthalates, dyes or irritants. All items are hand poured and hand scented in small batches in our Florida studio. We feature non-GMO and USA grown wax, premium essential oils and perfume oil blends as well as lead- and nickel-free wicks.Available Scents:Almond + Warm Cookie - A delicious mixture of a sweet cookie hot out of the oven and slivered almonds.Amber + Moss - This captivating scent has hints of orange, grapefruit with an infusion of sage that enhance the natural earthy quality.Caramel + Vanilla Bean - A gourmet fragrance offering rich warm vanilla as the centerpiece kissed with caramel.Grapefruit + Mangosteen - A true-to-life blend of tangy grapefruit and mangosteen- an exotic fruit.Green Tea + Lemongrass - A combination of herbal green tea leaves and citrusy lemongrass infuses this scent with irresistible freshness.Lavender + Sage - A camphoraceous blend of herbs, lavender, and aromatic woods.Linen + Patchouli - The sweet earthiness of patchouli and the crisp freshness of linen mingle with essences of strawberry, cherry, gardenia, violet leaf, orange flower and cedar wood.Oats + Honey - The sweet scent of honey with notes of nutty almond.Pineapple + Mango - Brazilian pineapple, Hawaiian coconut, and a touch of mango create this delectable scent.Sea Salt + Coconut - A tropical blend of fresh ocean air and sweet coconut is a staple year round.Teakwood + Tobacco - This scent starts out musky and a little bit sexy with top notes of leather, pepper and tobacco. A base of teak and sandlewood.Vanilla + Cream - An intense vanilla aroma with a subtle touch of cream.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WbqHESURL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Malicious Mermaid","source_asin":"B07K4ZBP6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K4ZBP6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K4ZBP6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
