window.products.push({"id":942317,"name":"Ebros Nautical Marine Coastal Blue And White Pacific Sea Nettle Jellyfish Ceramic Dinnerware For Beach Party Hosting Kitchen And Dining Serveware (Sma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VjJP9IKBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Icons of the ocean imbue our exclusive Jellyfish Themed Serveware Collection with refreshing maritime flair. Exquisitely detailed, it will make an anchor serveware piece crafted from double walled ceramic earthenware. The design concept includes marine themed icons like the sea shells, conches, ship helms, bubbles, the abstract octopus itself and more! The color theme is blue and gold against white backdrop, with other refreshing colors to imbue the masterpiece kitchen collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VjJP9IKBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ebros Gift","source_asin":"B08CF16SCV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CF16SCV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CF16SCV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":942318,"name":"Cushion Lab Extra Support Travel Pillow, Award-Winning Patented Ergonomic Design for Chin & Neck Support Memory Foam Neck Pillow, Compact Airplane Pil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VuLbUALrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【AWARD-WINNING, SLEEP BETTER ON THE MOVE】Picked by season frequent travelers at SmarterTravel as the Best Travel Pillow of 2019. Our travel pillow provides abundant neck & chin support for prolonged & relaxed resting on a plane, car, train or bus, even camping. Sleep better and arrive charged and refreshed. 【360 CHIN & NECK MULTI-SUPPORT FOR ANY SLEEPER】 Our patented ergonomic design features specially designed contours to provide support and comfort to any sleeping position, simply rotate the pillow to find your ideal support and say goodbye to neck strains. 【EXTRA SUPPORT WITH HYPERFOAM】 Our extra-dense memory foam is dynamically rebounding and extra supportive. It comfortably supports your head & chin to relieve pressure at neck & shoulder. 【COOLING ULTRA SOFT WASHABLE COVER W/ ADJUSTABLE STRAP】 The cooling hypoallergenic inner cover is ultra-soft and breathes to wick away moisture. The outer cover is hard-wearing and features a quick-adjust strap to help you find the ideal fit and support. Removable & washable for easy clean & care. 【COMPACT SIZED & LIGHTWEIGHT, TRAVEL BAG INCLUDED】 The pillow size is 9x10x5 inches (LxWxH) and 0.6 lbs. It can be compressed to be 1/2 the size. The included travel bag protects the pillow and makes it unobtrusive & super portable. You can clip it to your bag, backpack, or carry on luggage without taking up precious storage space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VuLbUALrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C CUSHION LAB","source_asin":"B08123LNGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942318","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08123LNGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08123LNGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":942319,"name":"Entertaining with Caspari Christmas Trees Continuous Roll Wrapping Paper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uUrdySDKL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Caspari Christmas Trees Continuous Roll Wrapping Paper is what the holiday season is all about. Beautifully wrapped hostess gifts and packages for your loved ones will certainly bring a smile to many faces. The Caspari Christmas Trees continuous wrap is one sheet of wrapping paper that is 30-inches wide and between 9-12 feet long. This paper is printed in the USA using environmentally sounds products. The paper features a toss of artsy lime green and red trees against a pure white background for a fun look. This paper creases nicely and the ink will not crack, so your packages will stay wrapped and pretty for the entire holiday season. Buy the paper you want from the name you can count on for wrapping paper, trimmings, paper tabletop and more! Be decorative with Caspari.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uUrdySDKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caspari","source_asin":"B000VL83OI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VL83OI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VL83OI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":942320,"name":"OLYDON Electric Heated Floor Mats Under Desk, Heated Foot Warmer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WuT4SgenS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEPS TOES WARM: Our warm foot pads are made of materials with excellent heating properties that heat quickly. There is no need to remove your shoes, just put your feet on the pad. Whether at home or work, it will keep your feet and toes warm and comfortable. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: The surface material of the heating pads is floor leather which is waterproof, wear-resistant, and high temperature resistant, and has excellent heat transfer performance. There are non-slip particles on the back of the product to prevent the product from moving. SAFE & ENERGY SAVING: The Cozy Foot Warmer uses only 55 watts, which is just a fraction of the energy used by traditional space heaters. It can be used normally at a voltage of 90-130V and has the function of temperature overheat protection. The default temperature on startup is 115℉. The product will auto-off after 3 hours. PORTABLE & VERSATILE USE: This small heated floor mat is easy to carry, can be rolled up for convenient, easy to store. Convenient to use in many life scenes: kitchen, office, dining room, living room, study, bedroom and other living places. EASY TO USE: Foot switch with temperature display. You don't need to bend over, just open it with your feet. Step and hold for more than 2 seconds to switch on or off. In the power-on state, lightly step on to set any of the 7 temperatures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WuT4SgenS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLYDON","source_asin":"B08VD588WM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942320","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VD588WM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VD588WM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
