window.products.push({"id":942719,"name":"Pacific Merchants 14\" Beechwood Heavy Wooden Mixing/Cooking Spoon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LTomToEML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pacific merchants source their olive wood from small artisan factories and you can see the actual carving by hand on each piece. Olive wood is considered the crème de la crème for making wooden spatulas, hardwood tools and wooden kitchen utensils due to its beauty, hardness and durability. The hardness of olive wood means seasoning tools like these are resistant to liquid penetration, staining or picking up odours. From the sanded smooth handles that feel easy and comfortable in your hand to beautifully carved seasoning spoon shapes that are elegantly simple. No two pieces of olive wood are the same. Each piece has natural imperfections in the wood grain, which are normal 'beauty marks' and are usually accompanied by interesting grain patterns. Like a work of art, each and every piece has a contrasting hand stitched appearance that it has been stitched. Each piece is stamped 'Made in France' showing pride in craftsmanship. Take care of your Olivo olive spoon and you will enjoy using it for years and years. C 'est Magnifique.<br/> French wooden utensils have a rich history and an important place in culinary culture. All French Wooden Spoons, Tools, and Spatulas are handcrafted and imported from France, and are therefore of the highest quality and beauty. Wooden spoons will not discolor food, alter flavor, conduct heat, or melt. Pacific Merchants, believes in the \"nature of things well made, durable, and nature has provided a material in line with this belief.\" Olivo is extremely strong and dense, with a tight grain that resists fraying edges. Cleaning is simple; wash warm and line dry.<br/> A heavier version of the regular wooden spoon for stirring thick soups and stews or folding dense dough easily. Available in sizes from 12\" to 18.\" The thick, solid wooden handle promises a comfortable, satisfying grip that won't absorb heat and burn your hand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LTomToEML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PACIFIC MERCHANTS","source_asin":"B01MREDRV4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MREDRV4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MREDRV4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
