window.products.push({"id":942820,"name":"ZYLISS \"Safe Edge\" Smooth Safety Can Opener, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jPj0Q1vQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looks like nothing has happened! The Safe Edge Can Opener cuts the seal where the lid and can meet. No more sharp edges! The hygienic cutting wheel never touches the food or leaves sharp edges on the can or lid. A unique metal clamp attaches to lid of your cans for easy, safe and clean removal of the lid. This distinctive can opener lets you reuse the lid to store can contents for a short time. It's safe, easy and hygienic. Zyliss Safe Edge Can Opener The Zyliss Safe Edge Can Opener offers an innovative solution to a bothersome and often unsafe chore. It opens the can from the top and importantly, leaves no sharp edges on the lid or the can. It features a unique metal clamp on the front of the opener that attaches to the lid, easily removing the lid after opening. This insures the safest handling possible. The opener is hygienic because the cutting wheel never touches food. Ergonomic Design Like all tools in the Zyliss gadget line, the Safe Edge Can Opener is engineered to make its use comfortable and tireless. According to the Zyliss Product Development Team, \"to become the consumer's choice, Zyliss differentiates itself from the competition in a value-added way. We conducted extensive human factor research to closely examine the demands of the task, and created the Safe Edge Can Opener which offers a functionality that maximizes efficiency\". Designed for right or left-handed use, the Safe Edge Can Opener is ergonomically adapted to body posture and the range of motion required so the user will feel as if the opener is an extension of his or her own hand. No sharp edges The Zyliss Safe Edge Can Opener cuts the seal where the lid and can meet to eliminate sharp edges on the can and lid. Hygienic The hygienic cutting wheel never touches the food so the opener stays clean. No gummed up gears! And the lid never falls into your food. Safe lid removal A unique metal clamp attaches to the lid of your cans for easy, safe and clean removal of the lid. Your fingers never need to touch the lid. The lid goes from the can to the opener and right into the trash. Comfort grip handles Rubber nonslip handles provide a comfortable grip for hands of all shapes and sizes. Stain-resistant UV protected to resist stains and yellowing. How to use 1. Open handles in direction of arrow and position can opener at the edge of can top 2. Place cutting wheel against can rim 3,4. Apply downward pressure and close handles to grip lid. Turn knob clockwise until can moves one full rotation. Note: Due to unique design, cut marks will not be visible on can lid as can opener is working. When less resistance is felt, the lid is open. 5. To release can, open handles 6,7,8. To remove lid, clasp lip of lid between round metal \"lid lifters\". Close handles to grip lid and lift with a slight twist. Care: To maintain sharpness of cutting wheel, wash can opener by hand. About Zyliss Focusing on functionality, durability, design, cleanliness and safety, Zyliss has relied upon a heritage of excellence that began in Switzerland over 60 years ago. Building on this time-held tradition, the company has advanced to produce and distribute kitchen equipment that is world-renowned. Zyliss has pioneered the design of more than 200 kitchen essentials, with quality and engineering that cannot be duplicated.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jPj0Q1vQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zyliss","source_asin":"B07657L2SM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07657L2SM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07657L2SM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
