window.products.push({"id":942919,"name":"Christmas Ball Ornaments 34ct Champagne Christmas Tree Decorations with Hang Rope-Shatterproof Christmas Ornaments Set in Medium Size (2.36\"/ 60mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916H+dKfABL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Stunning Christmas Ornaments] Embodying a mix of glam and enchantment, these stunning Christmas ball ornaments can be a worthy supplement to your holiday decor! Each piece showcases a gleamy appearance and comes in multiple finishes. Embrace the wonder of the season with these beautiful Christmas ornaments and luxurious Christmas tree decorations to treasure for years to come. [Christmas Ornaments Set of 34] This dazzling ornaments set comes with 34 medium champagne Christmas balls (2.36\", 60mm), that feature 6 different styles. It will allow you to build your collection quickly and decorate with more possibilities. Bring home these shiny ball ornaments to sparkle up your decor! [Commercial-Grade Ornaments] The Christmas balls feature a SHATTERPROOF & LIGHTWEIGHT plastic construction that cleverly combines the beauty and luster of glass with the safety of plastic ensuring you can enjoy their elegant charm season after season. They're ideal for public displays and recommended for INDOOR or OUTDOOR use. [Child & Pet Friendly] Use these shatterproof ornaments to enhance your Christmas tree decoration. The shatterproof design making them an ideal option for families with pets and children. Come with hanging loops, making them easy to attach to the tree, hang on garland or hang for use as other decoration without weighing anything down. Remove the loops to use as fun and sparkly decorative filler for bowls and vases! [100% Guaranteed Satisfaction] We would like you to have the best possible experience with us. If you have any questions or problems, please feel free to contact our 24/7 customer support team. we offer you a suitable solution as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916H+dKfABL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KAYH DECOR","source_asin":"B0B4VM6F28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-942919","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4VM6F28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4VM6F28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
